/** TypeDetailsForm holds the data fields for a TypeDetailsForm record.
 **/
// [🏘️compose📚js🗃️sketchpad💻type🔖imports🔖panels🔖right🔖details🪨typedetailsform](repo://p/u/compose/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Type.tsx/s/Imports/s/Panels/s/Right/s/Details/d/i/TypeDetailsForm)
